    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25055" root="صهب" body-key="S">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهِبَ</span></b> , (Mgh, L, Msb, TA,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهَبَ</span></b> , (Msb,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهَبٌ</span> (Mgh, * L, Msb, TA) [and app.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُهُوبَةٌ</span> also, and perhaps <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُهْبَةٌ</span>, q. v.], said of hair,
[and of a camel's fur or hair,] <i>It was,</i> or <i>became,
such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْهَب</span>, i. e., <i>of the colour termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُهْبَة</span>; (Mgh, L, Msb, TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصهبّ</span></b>  and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصهابّ</span></b> . (L, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاهِبْ</span>.

